      "widgets_values": [
        "HOW TO USE\n1. Load Coarse Mesh: upload your mesh (TRELLIS.2, Pixal3D, Hunyuan3D or your own sculpt; GLB/OBJ/PLY).\n2. Reference Image: the image the mesh was made from. Any background, BiRefNet cuts it out.\n3. Queue. The meshes are saved to ComfyUI/output/hi3d/.\n\n6-8 GB GPU: keep hi3d_v1_int8. 12 GB+: hi3d_v1 (fp16) also works.\nNodes and weights by AeroX (github.com/Aero-Ex). Workflow by PixelArtistry."
      ],
      "widgets_values_named": {
        "text": "HOW TO USE\n1. Load Coarse Mesh: upload your mesh (TRELLIS.2, Pixal3D, Hunyuan3D or your own sculpt; GLB/OBJ/PLY).\n2. Reference Image: the image the mesh was made from. Any background, BiRefNet cuts it out.\n3. Queue. The meshes are saved to ComfyUI/output/hi3d/.\n\n6-8 GB GPU: keep hi3d_v1_int8. 12 GB+: hi3d_v1 (fp16) also works.\nNodes and weights by AeroX (github.com/Aero-Ex). Workflow by PixelArtistry."
